amics around Trump's rally appearances, or movement from the trans-ad controversy, could tip this either way.", "confidence": "medium", "notes": ["Open seat: Joni Ernst (R) is not on the ballot."]}, "overview": "Iowa's open Senate seat is one of the closest races on the 2026 map. Joni Ernst's retirement leaves both parties contesting a state that has drifted Republican in recent cycles but where Democrats are energized this midterm. Josh Turek has raised more than $24 million, outpacing Ashley Hinson, and outside groups have poured roughly $10 million into opposing her.\n\nPolling averages sit within a point of even, with recent surveys split between narrow Democratic and Republican leads, and nearly every expert rater calls the race a Tossup. Prediction markets give Hinson a modest edge. With the fundamentals favoring Democrats but the state lean and markets favoring Republicans, the race is genuinely up for grabs heading into Election Day.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.6012, "margin": 1.25}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.5782, "margin": 0.8}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.5857, "margin": 0.8}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.5846, "margin": 0.8}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.4983, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.503, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.579, "margin": 0.8}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.5896, "margin": 0.8}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.5557, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.499, "margin": -0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.5985, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.607, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.6056, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.506, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.5021, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.5425, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.5748, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.4654, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p